# November 19, 2026: Sierra County, California, the gold-rush country of the North Yuba: Downieville, Goodyears Bar,
# Sierra City, Forest City and Alleghany, with the Henness Pass Road country to the east (Webber Lake, Kyburz Flat,
# Sierraville). Region drawn at random by tools/choose.py (ca, the whole state); the county by a random draw.
# Sources read in this session: HMdb marker pages (full inscriptions; most pins start from their positions), the National
# Register nomination forms (NPGallery "_text" PDFs read with tools/page.py), Wikipedia (tools/wiki_raw.py), the Sierra
# County Historical Society's Kentucky Mine page and its newsletter The Sierran (Winter 2019), the Lost Sierra Chamber
# page, The Mountain Messenger, NoeHill, the Truckee Donner Land Trust's Webber Lake pages and the National Forest
# Foundation's Tahoe page. Tahoe National Forest's own pages for Kyburz Flat and the Sierra Buttes lookout were not found
# (404): those hours are not checked. Interiors were not visited by any source opened unless the entry says so.
